                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Game looks quite nice. Totally unflyable.  This is because control inputs don't center.  If you nudge the mouse to bank left then take your hand off the mouse, it'll just roll all day.  Same with yaw, pitch, and altitude inputs.  The developer also in a shocking WHAT?! faupaux has mapped SHIFT+TAB to a control that cannot be re-bound.  Shift+Tab in a steam game summons up the steam browser from the background, pausing the game.  What were you thinking, guy?  I'm at a total loss of faith in this project based on that.\n\nRefunded.",
